WEBVTT

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:08.770
Execute spell armor!

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:15.580
They've got perfect frontline defense.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:17.210
Let's go, Mito!

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:24.040
Commence providing chains!

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.010
Here ya go!

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:39.680
By my name as Argent Loup...

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:48.560
I order you to howl, Argent Shayna!

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:02.050
I am Musashi Ariadust Academy's 5th
Special Agent in the Supreme Federation,

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:05.250
Nate Argent Loup Mitotsudaira!

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:09.360
Gents, I look forward to fighting you.

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:32.230
Nani ga mieru?

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:32.230
What do you see?

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:35.650
Ari no mama no kimi wa

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:35.650
You've closed yourself off to love

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:41.540
Tsuyoku naru made itoshisa wo tojite

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:41.540
Until you grow innately strong

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:44.620
Nani wo kiku no?

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:44.620
What are you listening to?

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:47.710
Himitsu no kobeya de

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:47.710
Shall I tell you about days long past

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:53.550
Inishie no hibi katarou ka?

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:53.550
In our secret little room?

00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:56.760
Kioku ni dakarete

00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:56.760
Embraced in memories

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:00.050
Kudakareta mysteria

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:00.050
The mysteria crumbles

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:02.810
Higeki wo koete

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:02.810
Once you overcome this tragedy

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:05.020
Odayaka na inori

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:05.020
Offer a gentle prayer

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:09.040
Owari ga hajimari

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:09.040
Endings are just beginnings

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:12.230
Shinsekai de hito wa mirai wo

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:12.230
People toss aside all they have

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:14.820
Bishu no you ni

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:14.820
Without ever knowing

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:18.290
Nomi hoseru ka sae shirazu

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:18.290
If they could drink up the new world

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:21.450
Subete houri nageta

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:21.450
Like a savory wine

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:24.610
Shinsekai wa tsumetai risei to

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:24.610
The new world resides

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:27.330
Kiseki no hazama

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:27.330
Between boring logic and miracles

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:36.340
Doushite koko de kimi to aeta no

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:36.340
I wonder why this is where I first met you

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:48.930
Hey! Hey, ya!

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:52.490
I am on my way, my king!

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:54.230
Add two chains.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:18.760
You may praise me with words of gratitude.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:22.890
Oh, good girl! Stay, stay!

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:23.930
I am not a dog!

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:27.260
Too true! You're a knight, Nate.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:34.190
Let's pave the way, my king.

00:03:32.710 --> 00:03:37.500
Musashi's Mr. Impossible

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:38.030
May your loss be as you desire.

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:44.620
Leave these guys to me and go on ahead.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:45.570
'Kay!

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:48.630
<i>Aerial warships in the western meeting grounds,</i>

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:51.580
<i>continue to fire upon Musashi
as you commence your retreat.</i>

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:55.790
<i>On land, Musashi's knight and
God of War have stormed in,</i>

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:58.480
<i>throwing our battle lines into turmoil.</i>

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:01.960
<i>The enemy is drawing in towards
the Mikawa land port.</i>

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:05.550
This requires imagination.

00:04:07.070 --> 00:04:09.640
Your Holiness, does your getting up mean...

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:14.890
Can I stay seated and leave things
to your imagination?

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.570
Well? Can I?

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:21.860
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:25.940
Are we there yet, Tenzo?

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:28.760
Everyone's running out of external energy.

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:31.750
We're practically there once we get by that ship.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:36.830
Who are they?

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:41.590
This is K.P.A. Italia's official army.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:45.550
They're on a whole different level
from those other guys.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:54.930
Wow! They're pretty good.

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:58.430
That's because they're
more seasoned and experienced.

00:04:58.430 --> 00:04:59.480
Gramps!

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:02.030
<i>Call me "Your Highness," kiddo.</i>

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:03.940
Isn't that...

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:05.600
It is!

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:10.030
It's the Armor of Deadly Sins for lust,
Staseis Porneia.

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:26.130
Huh? This doesn't look good!

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:32.570
This Armor of Deadly Sins lacks offensive abilities.

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:35.100
But once Staseis Porneia enters its super-drive,

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:40.170
it utterly emasculates the armament belonging
to anyone it views as an enemy

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:42.940
within a 3km radius.

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:46.650
We've won this battle!

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:48.230
-Come on, all you good kids!
-Hey, everyone!

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:51.940
-It's time for a special lecture with Nenji and I!
-Check out the Ohiroshiki family chain booth,
Rarely Metabolisable!

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:54.370
-Are you ready to get all sticky and slimy today, kids?
-Today our booth will be serving curry!

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:55.810
Guys...

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:02.490
Our weapons weren't the only things weakened.

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:06.040
If we try to strike out with our feet and fists,

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:09.220
they lose oomph the second we make contact.

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:21.480
Youch!

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.600
Can't we do something?!

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:38.580
Do you truly want to pull through for me?

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:44.010
Do you truly want to save Horizon?

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:45.820
Of course!

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:46.760
That's right!
Of course!

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:48.500
That's right!
No matter what the excuse,

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:52.500
if we saw someone about to be unjustly killed,

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:55.390
I believe anyone from the Far East
would want to save them.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:56.570
Right!

00:06:56.570 --> 00:07:00.800
I can't say I've ever believed it's okay to kill someone!

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:03.510
That so?

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:06.860
You all feel that way?

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:17.050
Cool.

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:22.330
Hey, Asama, go ahead and do it!

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:25.090
<i>Please sanction my contract.</i>

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:28.180
Are you serious?

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:29.300
<i>Please!</i>

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:33.450
Asama Shrine

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:34.460
Please don't forget:

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:41.920
Asama Shrine
White Sand Plinth
Asama Shrine

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:35.870
Should something happen,

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:39.270
Asama Shrine will back you up to its fullest.

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:41.920
Confirmation

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:41.040
<i>You upset?</i>

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:41.940
You bet!

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:46.820
But I know that you won't change your mind.

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:51.980
I, Tomo Asama, represent
Asama Shrine's Contractor, Tori Aoi.

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:56.770
Tori Aoi has personally applied for
a high-ranking contract, which I sanction.

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:58.850
I will present it to the shrine.

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:00.370
Ready!

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:03.530
The requested protection utilizes
protection from Mitsuba,

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:05.770
under the Deity of Performing Arts, Uzume.

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:08.350
It transmits and distributes all of
the contractor's abilities.

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:12.720
This allows you to share all you
have to offer with others.

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:23.460
ACTIVATING

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:24.540
Impossible

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:29.300
Impossible - Impossible - Impossible

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:40.530
Huh?

00:08:40.530 --> 00:08:44.000
You won't get anything out of
transmitting "Impossible!"

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:46.580
You're going down, Far East!

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:48.670
Get in position, Me's!

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:53.550
Defensive spells?

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:55.990
I thought they ran out of external energy!

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:01.470
Is this why you wanted to become king?!

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:04.720
What do you mean?

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:09.620
As Musashi's viceroy, that fool currently possesses

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:08.050
One, two, three, four!

00:09:08.050 --> 00:09:10.140
Two, two, three, four!

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:11.570
one-fourth control of Musashi.

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:12.320
Three, two - whoo!

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:17.980
That means he can freely use one-fourth
of Musashi's ether reserves.

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:20.150
Those fighting alongside him can essentially receive

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:23.620
an inexhaustible supply of ether
through the platonic plates.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:28.420
In other words, they could constantly
use spells for all eternity.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:33.170
But will he be okay?

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.090
This protection requires him

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:38.680
to offer feelings
of happiness as a ritual offering.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.380
In other words, he must be constantly happy.

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:45.860
If he gets sad or upset, he will have
failed to make his offerings.

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:48.520
He will be purified of all his abilities and vanish.

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:51.990
<i>In short, if you get sad henceforth,</i>

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:54.460
Asama Shrine

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:57.450
<i>you will die, Tori.</i>

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:13.160
Relax!

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:19.190
I, Tori Aoi, am here together with
my "impossible" powers!

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:25.390
I will take whatever is impossible for you upon myself!

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:29.850
So, use whatever powers you possibly can!

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:41.590
Judge!

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:50.330
<i>Wh..What was that?</i>

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:54.110
If I were to describe what happened,

00:10:54.110 --> 00:10:56.960
I would say a hole appeared in my book.

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:59.290
<i>Huh? What do you mean?</i>

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.790
A hole appeared in my book.

00:11:02.450 --> 00:11:03.970
<i>You meant it literally.</i>

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:08.730
It seems I'll have to stop reading soon.

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:12.010
We'll hold them back!

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:15.980
Hey, now, guys.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.360
Don't push yourselves just because you can.

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:20.170
We don't have a choice!

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:22.290
This is the only way.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:27.370
Someone! Anyone!

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:29.020
Is anyone around who can stand

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:31.830
up to the Pope President's Armor of Deadly Sins?

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:33.440
Divine Transmission

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:33.460
<i>You've got me!</i>

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:41.130
This is Vice-President Masazumi Honda
from Musashi Ariadust Academy.

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:47.640
I request a one-on-one duel with
Pope President Innocentius of K.P.A. Italia.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:50.430
My...

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:52.740
<i>As representative of the Testament Union,</i>

00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:55.730
<i>you wouldn't dream of running
from a duel, would you?</i>

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:57.270
Very well!

00:11:57.300 --> 00:12:00.470
Kitano Tenmangu Shrine

00:11:57.740 --> 00:12:00.490
<i>I accept your challenge.</i>

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:04.720
Rarely Metabolisable

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:02.740
What an idiot!

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:04.740
No, he's being manly!

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:08.250
But if he accepts a challenge now...

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:19.780
Starting Up

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:19.800
Could it be...

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.800
He's lifted the Armor of Deadly Sins' ability!

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:23.800
We can do this!

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:29.010
I'm on my way.

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:30.140
Your Holiness!

00:12:30.570 --> 00:12:32.550
The footing here is bad.

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:35.870
I'd like to move the battlefield to the
western meeting grounds.

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:36.610
<i>No!</i>

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:39.250
<i>Come here if that area's unacceptable.</i>

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:40.820
Judge.

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:43.220
<i>Please give me some time.</i>

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:44.950
Yeah, just hurry on over!

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:04.260
You bitch!

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:10.680
If you won't come, I'll just have to go to you!

00:13:12.130 --> 00:13:15.150
He's unfortunately as quick-tempered as ever.

00:13:15.150 --> 00:13:16.150
Now, then...

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:20.860
You again?

00:13:21.970 --> 00:13:24.950
The Pope will get angry if you don't do your job.

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:29.460
It is important to think things through, boy.

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:34.410
Didn't you learn anything from the prior outcome?

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:42.630
You're quite slow.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:44.590
Ptolemaic Theory!

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:55.390
Did he really charge me head-on
without any forethought?

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:57.390
This is tough...

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:59.310
Are you merely buying time?

00:14:01.550 --> 00:14:02.250
Universal Spell of Creation "March": Activated
3

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:04.440
I'm taking you down.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:08.860
Do you even know what my spell does?

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:13.200
It's a reproduction spell of astronomical revolution.

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:15.270
It's orbital motion!

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:18.560
Good answer.

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:22.640
I'm currently using Heliocentrism,

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:25.250
which allows me to orbit around my target.

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:28.620
And this places me in the center

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:31.250
and forces my target to orbit around me.

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:33.310
It's the Ptolemaic Theory.

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:34.290
Annotation for
Spell of Creation
"March": Activated
3

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.020
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:14:42.530 --> 00:14:46.130
The Spell of Creation "January" is all set!

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.780
<i>That must be it.</i>

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:56.540
<i>He's going through "March" and
"February" to "January."</i>

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:58.990
By offering your first two punches,

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:02.380
you obtain a stronger spell for the third.

00:15:02.740 --> 00:15:04.220
Isn't that right?

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:06.590
You didn't have to spill it out if you knew.

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:07.890
That's...

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:09.440
Are you familiar with it, Four-Eyes?

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:10.680
Yeah...

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:21.880
Kitano Tenmangu Shrine

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:15.060
"March" is an offering that lets
him blow off any defense.

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.720
"February" is an offering that lets his

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:20.640
punches hit anything hard and strong.

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:21.900
And then...

00:15:22.050 --> 00:15:23.520
I'm warning you,

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:27.070
there's nothing I can't punch
once I've made my two offerings!

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:28.880
Heliocentrism!

00:15:36.350 --> 00:15:39.170
That was my third hit on Heliocentrism:

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:40.330
"January."

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:46.800
That was my second time hitting you, wasn't it?

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:51.350
Since it doesn't look like you've
figured it out, I'll tell you.

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:55.010
I'll defeat you with my third punch!

00:15:58.470 --> 00:16:01.180
<i>He's broken through my Ptolemaic Theory
and Heliocentrism.</i>

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:03.510
<i>But this is...</i>

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:05.710
<i>Intriguing!</i>

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:09.900
I see your celestial bodies are
two-dimensional pictures on paper.

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:15.120
Can't you look straight up with a telescope?

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:19.620
Galileo, you heretic!

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:21.210
You're going down!

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:46.360
That's one job out of the way.

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:52.190
Don't move!

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:54.990
I lose! I'm fine with losing!

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:04.080
You've lost!

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:05.580
Right!

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:06.580
So!

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:09.090
Between our previous exchange and this one,

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:11.590
I've won twice, got it?!

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:12.460
Yes!

00:17:13.730 --> 00:17:15.180
And see here...

00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:16.970
Wh..What is it?

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:20.310
If you're a girl, you better dress like one!

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:22.810
Not a lecture!

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:26.040
Listen up!

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:29.730
Musashi's Vice-President pulled a lame feint,

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:33.400
but she has totally repented
after getting a lecture from me!

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:36.800
<i>Justice will always prevail!</i>

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:41.370
<i>And as long as I am around,
we will never wander astray!</i>

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:43.080
Everyone, repeat after me!

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:49.960
With the Testament in our world,
all outcomes are filled with justice!

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:54.630
With the Testament in our world,
all outcomes are filled with justice!

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.090
We do as the Testament dictates!

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:59.600
We make decisions based upon the Testament!

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:03.140
Tes, Tes, Tes!

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:06.390
They're nuts...

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:13.900
That's weird.

00:18:14.430 --> 00:18:17.830
For them to still be attacking...

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:20.270
Does that mean we stand a chance?

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:21.740
Neshinbara,

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:30.190
Kitano Tenmangu Shrine
Divine Transmission

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:24.220
<i>are you still in contact with Futayo?</i>

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:27.420
No, I lost contact with her a while ago.

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:29.810
<i>I see, that means...</i>

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:35.190
Yeah, she's probably encountered
Muneshige Tachibana.

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:40.400
Aligned with Alcala de Henares, Tres España,

00:18:40.400 --> 00:18:43.510
I am the 1st Special Agent and Strike Force...

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:47.390
Muneshige Tachibana.

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:51.460
Aligned with Musashi Ariadust Academy
of the Far East,

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:53.820
I am the temporary Vice Chancellor
and Strike Force...

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:57.740
Futayo Honda.

00:18:58.180 --> 00:18:59.110
Are you alone?

00:18:59.520 --> 00:19:01.990
Yes, does the same go for you?

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:04.870
Yeah, since I don't have any friends!

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:07.750
The Chancellor isn't supplying me with ether either!

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:11.330
Hey, Gin!

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:15.230
How should I speak to someone
with complex issues?

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:18.690
<i>Tes, I'm more complex than any other woman.</i>

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:20.380
<i>She's 1/5th as complex as me.</i>

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:21.340
Uh-huh...

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:23.800
What brought you here?

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:26.530
Shouldn't you have used Slicing Dragonfly's
severing powers

00:19:26.530 --> 00:19:31.330
to defeat the Pope President's Staseis Porneia?

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:34.980
What have I done?

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.110
Eh?!

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:38.660
No, it is all right.

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:42.120
Four-Eyes and Seijun positioned me here.

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:44.650
I am certain they had good reason to do so.

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:46.120
You're rather optimistic.

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:50.000
Do you think you can defeat me?

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:53.500
My blood boils with excitement at getting to fight

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.480
one of the Eight Great Dragon Kings.

00:19:55.480 --> 00:19:56.590
Besides,

00:19:57.610 --> 00:20:00.470
I did not fight with all my might last time.

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:01.840
Same here!

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:03.340
I used fifty percent of my strength!

00:20:03.670 --> 00:20:05.470
I used thirty percent.

00:20:05.860 --> 00:20:07.390
No, I used twenty-five percent.

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:09.480
I was at fifteen percent!

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:13.350
In that case...

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:14.980
...let's fight for real.

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:36.040
Did you develop this fighting style when
sparing with your father?

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:40.450
Keep at it! There's more in you than this!

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:48.900
<i>She's upping her speed?</i>

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:51.310
<i>But she's too straightforward.</i>

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:08.950
I've got you!

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:17.630
Bind, Slicing Dragonfly!

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:21.510
Why?

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:24.510
I used what I learned from last time
to render it ineffective.

00:21:41.590 --> 00:21:44.550
Kitano Tenmangu Shrine

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:48.140
<i>This is directed at the residents of Musashi.</i>

00:21:47.510 --> 00:21:48.550
Rarely
Metabolisable

00:21:57.060 --> 00:22:01.710
<i>I am going to fire a shot at Musashi
using Lypē Katarripsi.</i>

00:21:57.730 --> 00:22:01.690
Kitano Tenmangu Shrine

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:05.590
<i>Even if you rescue Princess Horizon,</i>

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:07.720
<i>our reinforcements that are on the way</i>

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:12.600
<i>will simply take her back if Musashi cannot leave port.</i>

00:22:13.460 --> 00:22:16.520
<i>This battle will be determined by the flow of events.</i>

00:22:16.930 --> 00:22:21.610
<i>Lypē Katarripsi can destroy one of Musashi's ships</i>

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:24.490
<i>if I extract and supply it with enough ether.</i>

00:22:24.490 --> 00:22:25.580
<i>As such...</i>

00:22:27.830 --> 00:22:29.110
Hear me now!

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:32.580
Please evacuate Musashi immediately!

00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:39.060
The Warriors of the Three Kingdom's Unrivaled Play

00:22:37.730 --> 00:22:42.490
I wonder, why do all of the generals in this book

00:22:42.490 --> 00:22:45.520
lose a layer of clothes each time they lose a match?

00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:54.440
Kizu darake no yuuki wo daite aruki dasu yo

00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:54.440
I embrace my battered courage as I step forward

00:22:54.850 --> 00:23:02.900
Kono te de asu wo tsukuri dasu to kimeta kara

00:22:54.850 --> 00:23:02.900
I have decided to forge tomorrow with my own hands

00:23:03.990 --> 00:23:08.400
Saa, hoshi yo, terashite

00:23:03.990 --> 00:23:08.400
Oh, stars, shine upon

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:12.980
Koko ni ima umareta melody

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:12.980
The melody that was just born here

00:23:12.980 --> 00:23:17.720
Sono egao wo tonari de

00:23:12.980 --> 00:23:17.720
I would like to see that

00:23:17.720 --> 00:23:21.730
Mite itai to omoun da

00:23:17.720 --> 00:23:21.730
Smile of yours up close

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:31.260
Itami ni tsuranukarete, kimi no na wo sakenda

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:31.260
Piercing with pain, I screamed out your name

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:41.520
Mada tooi kyoukai no ue de itsuka tsutaetai

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:41.520
Someday I wish to tell you something on the horizon

00:23:39.760 --> 00:23:43.730
Itoshisa no fiore…

00:23:39.760 --> 00:23:43.730
My precious fiore…

00:24:07.190 --> 00:24:10.990
Next Episode
Opposition Against Crossing Over the Parallel Lines
